WEBVTT

01:39.200 --> 01:43.020
VIDEO CALLING JIANG QIAOXI

02:30.880 --> 02:32.640
- Jiang Qiaoxi.
- Hey, Yingtao.

02:33.240 --> 02:34.280
Where are you?

02:34.320 --> 02:35.780
Why weren't you online today?

02:36.820 --> 02:39.280
Sorry. Something came up over here.

02:39.320 --> 02:40.460
I forgot to tell you.

02:47.820 --> 02:49.040
Can you try

02:49.540 --> 02:51.280
to give me a heads-up next time?

02:51.780 --> 02:53.500
I get really worried when you do that.

02:55.660 --> 02:56.520
What?

02:57.260 --> 02:59.180
Worried I'd ghost you again?

03:02.020 --> 03:04.040
You've got a track record, okay?

03:04.080 --> 03:05.940
Don't act so innocent.

03:11.120 --> 03:11.960
Well…

03:12.960 --> 03:14.300
If you're busy,

03:14.800 --> 03:16.340
I'll let you go.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.120
We can video call tomorrow.

03:18.620 --> 03:19.560
Wait.

03:19.600 --> 03:22.540
It's fine. I'm on the way somewhere,
but I can still talk.

03:23.040 --> 03:26.180
Weren't you preping for the internship
at the school?

03:26.680 --> 03:27.740
How's that going?

03:27.780 --> 03:29.080
Not bad.

03:30.800 --> 03:31.780
I told you

03:31.820 --> 03:34.480
I'll be teaching a class
of first graders, right?

03:34.520 --> 03:35.360
I figured

03:35.400 --> 03:39.280
they might still like to hear
some fairy tales.

03:39.320 --> 03:40.680
So today,

03:41.180 --> 03:42.180
I went through

03:42.220 --> 03:44.760
storybooks from all over the world,

03:44.800 --> 03:47.640
trying to find something
fun and new to read them.

03:47.680 --> 03:51.000
Well, did you find anything good today?

03:51.520 --> 03:54.040
Wanna share with me, a big kid here,
one of the stories?

03:54.080 --> 03:56.920
A big kid asking for fairy tales?

03:58.780 --> 04:01.700
I read one called The Fox's Window.

04:01.740 --> 04:05.840
If you shape your hands
like a fox's window,

04:06.340 --> 04:09.060
you can see from the window

04:09.560 --> 04:11.540
for anything you wish for.

04:11.580 --> 04:14.020
Anything I wish for?

04:15.440 --> 04:16.940
How do you make the window?

04:17.839 --> 04:19.339
It's a little tricky.

04:19.839 --> 04:23.140
With your left hand back-facing,
right hand palm-facing towards your body.

04:23.180 --> 04:25.500
Then use your right middle
and ring fingers

04:25.540 --> 04:28.520
to press over your left index finger.

04:28.560 --> 04:29.680
Sounds like a tongue twister.

04:29.720 --> 04:31.540
Then you'll find,
when your fingers overlap,

04:31.580 --> 04:33.240
there's a tiny window in the middle.

04:33.820 --> 04:35.380
Yeah, sounds complicated.

04:35.880 --> 04:36.720
Well…

04:37.220 --> 04:39.080
I'll show you in person

04:39.120 --> 04:40.160
when we meet.

04:40.200 --> 04:41.120
Deal.

04:41.160 --> 04:45.040
Are you sure it will really show
what I wish for the most?

04:45.080 --> 04:46.400
Of course.

04:46.440 --> 04:48.480
You don't trust Ms. Lin?

04:48.520 --> 04:49.460
I do.

04:49.500 --> 04:50.580
So, you?

04:50.620 --> 04:52.540
What do you want to see most right now?

04:53.140 --> 04:54.840
Do I really have to spell it out?

04:55.440 --> 04:57.900
Jiang-Qiao-Xi.

04:59.800 --> 05:01.680
Jiang-Qiao-Xi.

05:05.180 --> 05:06.540
Then come to your balcony.

05:06.580 --> 05:08.760
Take your little fox window with you.

05:09.260 --> 05:12.000
Maybe you'll see exactly
what you're hoping for.

06:38.760 --> 06:41.840
A FEW YEARS LATER

07:14.900 --> 07:16.360
Jiang Qiaoxi.

07:18.220 --> 07:19.620
You scared me.

07:20.240 --> 07:21.120
Up so early?

07:21.620 --> 07:22.880
Smells amazing in here.

07:22.920 --> 07:24.460
Did you lose weight?

07:24.500 --> 07:25.480
You feel lighter somehow.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.960
- You serious?
- Totally.

07:27.000 --> 07:29.180
Then clearly you haven't been
feeding me enough.

07:29.220 --> 07:30.360
I haven't?

07:30.400 --> 07:31.800
Look what I made this time.

07:32.300 --> 07:33.140
Try it.

07:33.640 --> 07:34.640
Fresh out of the pan.

07:38.100 --> 07:38.960
Well?

07:39.480 --> 07:41.680
Alright, you eat.
I have to go to the office.

07:44.520 --> 07:45.540
Today again?

07:46.040 --> 07:47.880
The market's picking up.

07:47.920 --> 07:49.980
Boss wants to invest
in a few more startups.

07:50.580 --> 07:52.260
I have a meeting with one this morning.

07:52.300 --> 07:53.700
Have to hear their pitch.

07:57.780 --> 07:59.860
Be honest. What time
did you go to bed last night?

08:00.360 --> 08:02.380
Around 4:30 a.m.?

08:02.920 --> 08:04.240
It's 8:30 a.m. now.

08:04.280 --> 08:06.180
You barely got four hours of sleep--

08:07.420 --> 08:08.420
Hello?

08:09.940 --> 08:11.480
Yeah, I read the email. I know.

08:13.760 --> 08:14.600
Alright.

08:15.640 --> 08:16.660
I'll be there soon.

08:17.320 --> 08:18.160
You can't--

08:19.000 --> 08:19.840
Got it.

08:24.980 --> 08:27.500
And if the founders are just college kids,

08:27.540 --> 08:29.540
don't make it feel like an interrogation.

08:30.240 --> 08:31.580
Let them talk. Listen more.

08:32.360 --> 08:33.260
Yingtao,

08:33.760 --> 08:34.860
I'm heading out.

08:34.900 --> 08:35.740
Wait.

08:37.240 --> 08:40.020
You just graduated yourself,
and now you're calling them college kids?

08:41.919 --> 08:42.760
When will you be back?

08:43.760 --> 08:45.500
Tonight. I'll try to make it early.

08:45.540 --> 08:46.880
- Tonight?
- Hm.

09:05.780 --> 09:06.940
Qin Yeyun!

09:08.380 --> 09:09.300
Lin Yingtao,

09:09.340 --> 09:10.680
act your age. You're 25 now.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.620
It's embarrassing.

09:14.360 --> 09:16.620
You were supposed to visit
the wedding venue with Jiang Qiaoxi,

09:16.660 --> 09:17.660
and he didn't show up.

09:17.700 --> 09:19.320
So, what exactly are we doing here?

09:20.740 --> 09:21.920
Don't even ask.

09:22.420 --> 09:23.480
He says

09:23.520 --> 09:25.540
the investment market is hot right now.

09:25.580 --> 09:27.700
They've got him running
for meetings nonstop.

09:27.740 --> 09:30.500
He's like a wind-up toy lately.
All he cares about is stocks and deals.

09:30.540 --> 09:32.280
He's got no time for this.

09:33.380 --> 09:36.200
He doesn't even care
about his own wedding.

09:37.120 --> 09:38.940
Always at work, never home.

09:40.180 --> 09:41.700
You sure everything is okay?

09:42.720 --> 09:44.520
What are you saying?

09:46.160 --> 09:47.000
I'm saying,

09:47.520 --> 09:50.200
last time you cried and called me
was four years ago.

09:52.340 --> 09:53.180
It's been four years.

09:54.260 --> 09:55.500
Maybe it's time.

09:56.120 --> 09:58.340
Don't say stuff like that, Qin Yeyun.

09:58.380 --> 09:59.220
What?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.800
It's the truth.

10:00.840 --> 10:02.400
Men are like that.

10:02.440 --> 10:03.720
Thanks for the wisdom.

10:04.560 --> 10:07.080
You've known him growing up.
You know what he's like.

10:07.120 --> 10:09.040
Even when he's working late,

10:09.080 --> 10:11.200
he comes home in the morning
just to cook me breakfast.

10:11.240 --> 10:13.260
Sometimes I'm asleep
and he's already left for work,

10:13.300 --> 10:15.040
but the food's still warm in the pot.

10:16.720 --> 10:17.940
And what does that prove?

10:18.520 --> 10:20.700
That proves Jiang Qiaoxi likes cooking.

10:20.740 --> 10:23.540
He made your breakfast, sure,
but who's he making dinner for?

10:24.160 --> 10:25.980
One more word
and I'm tossing you in the water.

10:26.520 --> 10:27.540
Even I can't believe it.

10:27.580 --> 10:29.560
I'm surprised you're in gaming.

10:29.600 --> 10:32.140
I know this funding round

10:32.180 --> 10:33.420
is risky for our firm.

10:33.460 --> 10:34.660
But if it works out,

10:34.700 --> 10:36.440
everything that felt impossible in my head

10:36.480 --> 10:37.540
suddenly becomes possible.

10:38.820 --> 10:40.080
And if I fail,

10:40.620 --> 10:41.900
then I'll have nothing left.

10:44.440 --> 10:47.100
Have you looked over
Mr. Liang's contract carefully?

10:48.360 --> 10:49.540
The contract?

10:50.580 --> 10:51.760
I don't understand that stuff.

10:51.800 --> 10:53.980
My coworkers handle all the legal stuff.

10:54.480 --> 10:57.580
But they did say we're supposed to add
some kind of side agreement.

10:58.440 --> 11:00.040
You mean

11:00.540 --> 11:03.160
we're signing a drawer contract,

11:03.200 --> 11:05.980
where they give us a discount
to lower their issue price.

11:06.480 --> 11:09.480
And in exchange,
we increase our investment.

11:10.020 --> 11:11.820
If that's the case,

11:12.320 --> 11:15.560
the original shareholders
will be heavily diluted.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.940
That's their problem.

11:16.980 --> 11:18.520
What I care about

11:19.080 --> 11:20.420
is that this is a small company

11:20.460 --> 11:21.420
with core tech,

11:21.460 --> 11:23.440
in an up-and-coming gaming industry,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.340
and we can spin it for buzz.

11:25.380 --> 11:28.240
Once it takes off,
we buy low and sell high.

11:29.400 --> 11:31.680
Companies like theirs come to us hoping

11:31.720 --> 11:34.180
we can help them grow long-term.

11:34.940 --> 11:36.380
If we pull a move like this,

11:36.880 --> 11:38.920
isn't it kind of unfair?

11:39.600 --> 11:40.940
Getting the best outcome

11:40.980 --> 11:42.060
at any cost.

11:42.100 --> 11:43.420
That's the simplest rule

11:43.920 --> 11:45.620
in finance.

11:45.660 --> 11:46.600
Vincent,

11:46.640 --> 11:48.800
the sooner you figure out
what really matters,

11:48.840 --> 11:50.820
the better off we both are.

11:55.180 --> 11:57.460
Can you believe he forgot
something as important

11:57.500 --> 11:58.840
as checking the wedding venue?

11:58.880 --> 12:00.280
Said he had to work overtime.

12:00.320 --> 12:01.720
Honestly, what is wrong

12:01.760 --> 12:03.020
with Jiang Qiaoxi?

12:03.060 --> 12:04.500
Yingtao, just wait.

12:04.540 --> 12:05.720
Next time I see him,

12:05.760 --> 12:07.520
I'll give him a proper talk for you.

12:07.560 --> 12:08.480
Please do.

12:08.520 --> 12:09.500
Let him have it.

12:09.540 --> 12:10.880
Yingtao, I'm home.

12:10.920 --> 12:13.860
Perfect timing. Come here.
I'm on a video call with Uncle Jiang.

12:13.900 --> 12:14.920
Hurry up.

12:15.420 --> 12:16.420
What are you putting away?

12:16.460 --> 12:17.340
Come here.

12:17.380 --> 12:18.520
I bought some groceries.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.380
I'm talking to Uncle right now.

12:21.540 --> 12:23.500
- Dad.
- Back from work?

12:23.540 --> 12:24.580
Yeah, just finished.

12:28.020 --> 12:28.860
Say something.

12:30.460 --> 12:31.460
Hi, Dad.

12:31.500 --> 12:32.620
Everything good in Africa?

12:32.660 --> 12:34.940
I'm doing fine. Everything's good.

12:35.560 --> 12:36.480
Are you doing alright?

12:37.540 --> 12:38.540
Yeah, all good.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.780
Dad,

12:47.820 --> 12:49.200
I'll go make dinner.

12:49.240 --> 12:50.340
Go on then.

12:50.380 --> 12:51.560
Cook something nice for Yingtao.

12:51.600 --> 12:52.440
Take care, okay?

12:52.480 --> 12:53.540
Got it.

12:55.160 --> 12:57.460
What's the rush? I'm not even hungry yet.

13:22.080 --> 13:23.540
Hi. Flower delivery for you.

13:23.580 --> 13:24.980
I didn't order any flowers.

13:25.020 --> 13:29.660
"To my favorite teacher, Ms. Yingtao."

13:46.180 --> 13:47.340
These are for you.

13:47.380 --> 13:48.700
Stop sulking.

13:49.300 --> 13:50.820
I didn't forget what today is.

13:51.820 --> 13:55.240
Today marks 6,000 days since we first met.

13:57.380 --> 13:58.940
Sixteen years.

14:04.980 --> 14:05.820
Let's eat.

14:11.280 --> 14:13.500
Yingtao, what's really bothering you?

14:20.240 --> 14:21.880
I'm not in a rush to get married.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.600
But you kept saying,

14:24.600 --> 14:28.060
"Auntie Juan's jujube bun recipe
is only passed down to family, right?"

14:28.680 --> 14:32.140
Or "I have to call her Mom
to count as family, right?"

14:32.180 --> 14:34.840
You rushed me to get the marriage
certificate when we came of age,

14:34.880 --> 14:35.860
then

14:35.900 --> 14:37.500
kept pressuring me to plan the wedding.

14:37.540 --> 14:38.540
And now?

14:38.580 --> 14:39.780
Now that it's happening,

14:39.820 --> 14:41.080
you forget all about it.

14:44.680 --> 14:46.180
I'm sorry. I forgot.

14:46.680 --> 14:49.600
Today was the day we were supposed
to check on wedding venues.

14:51.140 --> 14:52.280
I seriously forgot.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.900
I've just been so swamped.

14:54.780 --> 14:55.760
I'm really sorry.

14:55.800 --> 14:57.060
I just remembered it now.

14:57.100 --> 14:58.040
I promise,

14:58.080 --> 15:01.000
if anything like this ever happens again,
I won't forget. Ever.

15:03.980 --> 15:06.380
Any free time I have,
I'll come help you arrange flowers.

15:08.100 --> 15:10.060
Time for flower arranging?
Are you quitting?

15:11.320 --> 15:14.180
This is me doing a heartfelt
reflection on my mistake.

15:17.320 --> 15:19.780
Morning, Ms. Lin!

15:19.820 --> 15:21.000
Morning, Ms. Lin!

15:21.040 --> 15:21.900
Morning, everyone.

15:21.940 --> 15:23.000
Don't run. Slow down.

15:23.920 --> 15:25.040
Good morning, Miss!

15:25.080 --> 15:26.000
Morning.

15:27.900 --> 15:29.220
Morning, Ms. Yingtao!

15:29.260 --> 15:30.200
Morning, Ms. Yingtao.

15:32.400 --> 15:33.980
Alright, class is starting soon.

15:34.020 --> 15:34.960
Hi, Miss.

15:35.000 --> 15:36.140
Hi, Miss.

15:36.180 --> 15:37.740
Hi, Miss.

15:37.780 --> 15:40.560
- Hi. Good morning.
- Ms. Lin, what did you do this weekend?

15:40.600 --> 15:41.580
I went out for burgers.

15:41.620 --> 15:43.760
I went to see my best friend.

15:43.800 --> 15:45.120
Miss, they say you're getting married.

15:45.160 --> 15:46.500
Is it true?

15:46.540 --> 15:47.740
Look, Ms. Lin.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.940
My mom bought me this new pencil case.

15:49.980 --> 15:51.320
- What do you think?
- It's lovely.

15:51.360 --> 15:52.580
Miss, I brought something too.

15:52.620 --> 15:53.940
- Miss…
- I have one…

15:53.980 --> 15:55.580
- Miss…
- I…

15:55.620 --> 15:56.460
Okay, settle down.

15:56.960 --> 15:59.100
Get ready for class now.

16:12.540 --> 16:14.980
What's up, Haolei?
Why are you sitting here all alone?

16:19.040 --> 16:20.680
How about I sit with you for a bit?

16:20.720 --> 16:21.940
Wanna tell me what's on your mind?

16:25.500 --> 16:27.600
Do you want the little chair
to protect you?

16:28.760 --> 16:29.620
But look,

16:29.660 --> 16:32.560
you've got your classmates all around,

16:33.060 --> 16:34.320
and the sun is shining too.

16:34.820 --> 16:37.660
I'm about to start storytime.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.960
Wanna come out and join us?

16:44.480 --> 16:46.380
Everyone packed their homework?

16:46.980 --> 16:49.820
Don't forget your textbooks tomorrow.

16:50.900 --> 16:52.360
Bye, Ms. Lin.

16:54.680 --> 16:55.720
Lin Qile.

16:59.060 --> 17:00.400
Cen Xiaoman.

17:01.580 --> 17:03.900
Are you picking up your kid?

17:03.940 --> 17:05.020
Oh no,

17:05.060 --> 17:06.500
I'm helping my boss pick up hers.

17:08.319 --> 17:09.460
You probably don't know.

17:09.500 --> 17:11.800
I am now working at a magazine
after my studies abroad.

17:11.839 --> 17:13.140
That's great. It suits you.

17:13.680 --> 17:15.619
Didn't think I'd bump into you today.

17:15.660 --> 17:17.760
What's that kid called?
I'll get them for you.

17:18.260 --> 17:19.880
Xu Haolei. He's in Class 1, Grade 1.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.460
That's my class.

17:22.760 --> 17:23.980
Lei!

17:24.020 --> 17:25.460
Someone's here to pick you up.

17:25.500 --> 17:27.400
Time to go, Lei.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.940
I've only seen him a couple of times,

17:31.980 --> 17:34.020
but every time, he's like this.

17:34.720 --> 17:36.860
My boss is a total career woman.

17:36.900 --> 17:38.840
Barely has time to be around him.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.960
So, it's not surprising
he's kind of quiet.

17:43.940 --> 17:46.300
I don't think he's just quiet.

17:46.340 --> 17:47.760
He seems really sensitive.

17:48.260 --> 17:49.780
And super imaginative.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.460
He'd imagine himself
as a little mushroom in the corner.

17:53.500 --> 17:54.760
Maybe

17:55.340 --> 17:56.920
you could

17:56.960 --> 17:59.700
try talk to him in that way,
as a mushroom.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.840
Is that how you won over Jiang Qiaoxi?

18:12.900 --> 18:14.760
If those dramas hadn't happened,

18:14.800 --> 18:16.760
I think we would've just been good friends

18:16.800 --> 18:18.200
in high school.

18:22.600 --> 18:23.620
Come on, Lei.

18:23.660 --> 18:25.020
Let's go get some candy.

18:25.960 --> 18:26.840
Say bye to Ms. Lin.

18:27.340 --> 18:28.280
See you tomorrow.

18:43.580 --> 18:44.820
Guys, turn on the news.

18:44.860 --> 18:45.960
Yu Qiao was in an accident.

18:46.000 --> 18:48.040
A black kite crashed
into his plane's engine.

18:48.080 --> 18:49.140
Yu Qiao…

18:52.600 --> 18:54.780
A Hongyang Airlines flight

18:54.820 --> 18:56.080
experienced a bird strike

18:56.120 --> 18:57.540
during takeoff…

18:57.580 --> 18:59.680
Within seconds,
the system detected the fault

18:59.720 --> 19:00.900
and warning lights came on.

19:00.940 --> 19:01.820
Yu Qiao.

19:01.860 --> 19:03.180
- Qin Yeyun.
- Come sit.

19:03.220 --> 19:04.620
Are you trying to kill us from panic?

19:04.660 --> 19:05.960
Why didn't you explain it properly?

19:06.000 --> 19:06.860
Stop running.

19:06.900 --> 19:08.220
- I'm not gonna eat you.
- Hey, you.

19:08.260 --> 19:09.100
You're late.

19:09.140 --> 19:10.360
- Stop right there.
- I'm fine.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.240
- I am good.
- A penalty drink.

19:11.280 --> 19:12.500
- I'm driving.
- All limbs attached.

19:12.540 --> 19:13.580
Still breathing. No problem.

19:13.620 --> 19:14.980
Then stop and let me check.

19:15.020 --> 19:16.000
Quit dodging.

19:16.040 --> 19:17.100
I swear I'm okay.

19:17.140 --> 19:18.700
Couldn't you just say that from the start?

19:18.740 --> 19:19.820
Had to give us a heart attack?

19:21.620 --> 19:22.860
I'm back now, aren't I?

19:22.900 --> 19:24.640
Drink some water and chill.

19:24.680 --> 19:27.360
You're still young. Maybe time
to consider switching careers?

19:27.400 --> 19:28.360
Qin Yequn,

19:28.400 --> 19:31.000
this isn't the time to say stuff
that kills the mood.

19:31.040 --> 19:31.960
Look at it this way.

19:32.000 --> 19:33.880
Now I've got real in-flight

19:33.920 --> 19:35.440
emergency experience.

19:35.480 --> 19:37.460
How many pilots can say
they've been through that?

19:38.260 --> 19:39.100
And let's be honest.

19:39.140 --> 19:41.520
A pilot who's been
officially commended like me,

19:41.560 --> 19:43.740
if I step away, that's a loss
for the civil aviation industry.

19:45.220 --> 19:46.060
Yeah, yeah.

19:46.100 --> 19:49.340
Once you've made up your mind,
no one can talk you out of it.

19:51.480 --> 19:52.820
Qin Yeyun told me

19:53.320 --> 19:56.960
the anti-cancer drug you were working on
tested positive for carcinogens.

19:57.800 --> 19:59.200
How's everything going now?

19:59.880 --> 20:00.720
Could be better.

20:00.760 --> 20:03.120
I knew at the time
when I chose to be a doctor,

20:03.160 --> 20:04.560
it was never gonna be easy.

20:05.100 --> 20:07.860
Especially now that I'm trying
to develop an anti-cancer drug.

20:07.900 --> 20:09.980
If there were no issues,
that'd be the real red flag.

20:10.800 --> 20:12.300
And if Yu Qiao can pull through

20:12.340 --> 20:14.200
a life-or-death flight,

20:14.240 --> 20:15.960
I'm sure I can handle it too.

20:16.000 --> 20:17.320
Otherwise, I'd be embarrassed.

20:17.360 --> 20:18.400
Right, Yu Qiao?

20:18.440 --> 20:19.320
Right.

20:19.360 --> 20:20.940
This is how a role model works.

20:20.980 --> 20:22.340
After I brought up my heroic story,

20:22.380 --> 20:23.880
this dinner instantly leveled up.

20:24.740 --> 20:25.840
Oh, please.

20:25.880 --> 20:26.740
To the role model.

20:26.780 --> 20:27.840
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

20:27.880 --> 20:28.820
- Here.
- To the role model.

20:28.860 --> 20:29.700
To the role model.

20:29.740 --> 20:32.980
It's been a while since we've
all been together like this.

20:33.940 --> 20:35.160
Do you remember that thing

20:35.200 --> 20:37.820
we never got time to do?

20:37.860 --> 20:40.680
I think today's the perfect day for it.

20:41.520 --> 20:42.360
What is it?

20:43.800 --> 20:45.160
Come on.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.140
Let's go.

20:46.180 --> 20:47.120
Come on.

20:48.760 --> 20:49.780
- We're all here.
- What is it?

20:49.820 --> 20:50.660
Quick, quick.

20:50.700 --> 20:51.900
Help me out.

20:51.940 --> 20:52.780
On it.

20:54.780 --> 20:55.780
- Put it there?
- So much stuff.

20:55.820 --> 20:56.660
Right?

20:59.240 --> 21:00.640
Honestly,

21:00.680 --> 21:02.940
it feels like I bought this car
just for this moment.

21:04.500 --> 21:06.080
- Let's hit the road.
- Get in, everybody.

21:06.580 --> 21:08.240
Qin Yeyun, you're driving?

21:08.740 --> 21:09.700
Of course.

21:09.740 --> 21:10.580
Okay.

21:10.620 --> 21:13.520
Then I'm riding shotgun.
You're co-pilot for the day.

21:19.260 --> 21:21.780
I want my hands on the wheel,

21:22.280 --> 21:23.320
with my music playing,

21:23.360 --> 21:24.260
and the road ahead of me,

21:24.300 --> 21:26.200
the best views waiting out there.

21:26.980 --> 21:29.240
And next to me, I want Yingtao,

21:29.280 --> 21:31.000
Cai Fangyuan, Du Shang,

21:31.860 --> 21:33.380
and even Yu Qiao.

21:36.920 --> 21:37.820
Wow.

21:47.780 --> 21:48.940
Qunshan Squad!

21:48.980 --> 21:50.420
Pilot ready for takeoff.

22:10.540 --> 22:12.220
We're not getting married
till later this year.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.840
Isn't it a bit early
for the wedding envelope?

22:15.580 --> 22:16.900
This isn't a wedding envelope.

22:17.600 --> 22:18.560
It's that half-letter

22:19.260 --> 22:21.140
Yingtao wrote you in Year 10.

22:21.180 --> 22:23.360
The one I snatched away.

22:25.680 --> 22:27.740
So, I've passed your probation? Approved?

22:28.240 --> 22:30.200
You've been promoted and certified.

22:30.700 --> 22:32.740
I am not the one to approve.

22:33.480 --> 22:34.700
This letter.

22:34.740 --> 22:36.160
I kept it in my possession for years.

22:36.200 --> 22:37.640
I always wanted to open it.

22:40.040 --> 22:41.340
But I never did.

22:42.720 --> 22:44.620
Took every ounce of my moral restraint.

22:45.780 --> 22:46.680
Now it's yours.

22:46.720 --> 22:48.700
Hot potato officially passed.

22:56.260 --> 22:57.220
Thanks.

23:02.340 --> 23:03.180
Yingtao.

23:03.900 --> 23:04.740
What's next?

23:05.260 --> 23:06.280
I want to try that one.

23:08.360 --> 23:09.280
They're done?

23:09.800 --> 23:10.720
All burned out.

23:18.160 --> 23:19.080
Yu Qiao.

23:22.340 --> 23:23.680
There were things I thought

23:23.720 --> 23:26.000
I'd never be able
to tell you in this life.

23:26.860 --> 23:28.560
But after your incident,

23:29.460 --> 23:31.520
I realized if I didn't say it,
I'd regret it forever.

23:32.100 --> 23:33.460
I don't want to live with that.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.940
Then tell me.

23:50.980 --> 23:54.100
I never know which flight you're on.

23:55.280 --> 23:56.620
But every time I look up

23:57.120 --> 23:59.060
and see a plane overhead,

24:00.060 --> 24:01.240
I always feel…

24:03.620 --> 24:04.480
it's gonna be you.

24:16.680 --> 24:19.060
Then, from now on,

24:19.920 --> 24:21.620
every time I'm up there,

24:22.540 --> 24:23.480
I'll look down

24:23.980 --> 24:25.300
and think about you

24:26.500 --> 24:27.500
looking up at me.

24:37.720 --> 24:38.740
That's all I wanted to say.

24:39.360 --> 24:40.340
Let's go set off fireworks.

24:40.380 --> 24:41.300
Let's go.

24:43.240 --> 24:44.860
- Run!
- Go, Qiaoxi!

24:44.900 --> 24:45.740
Go!

24:56.660 --> 24:57.720
So beautiful.

25:01.180 --> 25:04.460
Today saw a major correction across
the Shanghai and Shenzhen stock markets.

25:04.500 --> 25:06.560
Key indices dropped sharply

25:06.600 --> 25:08.460
and volatility spiked.

25:08.500 --> 25:09.920
Regulators said

25:09.960 --> 25:12.260
they're closely monitoring
market developments

25:12.300 --> 25:14.460
to help maintain stability.

25:14.500 --> 25:16.540
- Morning, Ms. Lin.
- The second the market opened,

25:16.580 --> 25:19.200
it crashed past 3,000 points.

25:19.980 --> 25:21.940
I thought my screen was broken.

25:22.440 --> 25:24.540
Can you believe that? What are the odds?

25:24.580 --> 25:27.680
My husband and I were this close

25:27.720 --> 25:29.920
to putting our one-bedroom money in

25:29.960 --> 25:32.460
- and turning it into a two-bedroom.
- What's going on with Ms. Sun?

25:33.020 --> 25:34.780
You didn't invest in the stocks.
You won't know.

25:34.820 --> 25:37.280
Over a thousand stocks
hit their lower limit.

25:37.320 --> 25:39.300
The index dropped straight to 3,000.

25:39.340 --> 25:41.000
That's a 40% wipeout.

25:41.040 --> 25:41.880
Lin Qile.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.140
What are you doing here?

25:47.900 --> 25:49.100
Have you talked to Jiang Qiaoxi?

25:49.140 --> 25:50.120
No. Why?

25:50.160 --> 25:51.560
His boss got taken in for questioning.

25:51.600 --> 25:52.960
Fei Linge just told me.

25:53.500 --> 25:54.780
Jiang Qiaoxi had warned him

25:54.820 --> 25:57.180
that the hedge fund they were working with
had a drawer contract.

25:57.220 --> 25:59.140
Said they might dump
their shares and bail.

25:59.640 --> 26:02.260
Once Fei Linge heard,
he backed out of the deal.

26:02.300 --> 26:03.820
Now the market's tanking.

26:03.860 --> 26:05.280
His boss is under investigation.

26:05.320 --> 26:07.080
Fei Linge tried calling,
but his phone's off.

26:07.580 --> 26:08.720
This is serious.

26:08.760 --> 26:10.000
I figured

26:10.040 --> 26:11.320
I had to come find you.

26:12.580 --> 26:13.660
Let me try calling him.

26:24.600 --> 26:26.100
I'll head home and check on him.

26:26.140 --> 26:26.980
Go now. Hurry.

26:33.800 --> 26:35.680
- Thanks.
- No need for that. Just go.

26:41.180 --> 26:42.180
TO JIANG QIAOXI, SUNFLOWERS ARE BLOOMING

26:42.220 --> 26:43.100
COME SEE THEM WITH ME

26:43.140 --> 26:44.400
Jiang Qiaoxi,

26:44.940 --> 26:46.800
I've said so much to you,

26:47.300 --> 26:48.940
but I forgot to ask.

26:49.840 --> 26:51.360
Do you still remember Chunlu?

26:52.120 --> 26:54.480
Do you still remember you're her dad?

26:55.760 --> 26:56.600
Do you

26:57.400 --> 26:58.920
still remember me?

27:00.260 --> 27:02.000
I've remembered you all along.

27:03.040 --> 27:04.000
When I think about you,

27:04.760 --> 27:06.720
I think about the days
when we were little.

27:08.900 --> 27:10.100
Back then,

27:10.140 --> 27:11.960
time flew in the blink of an eye.

27:12.600 --> 27:14.840
The ice cream cone was just in your hands

27:15.340 --> 27:16.660
and it'd be melting.

27:20.120 --> 27:22.140
We were just reaching the mountaintop

27:22.180 --> 27:23.540
for the sunset.

27:24.040 --> 27:26.580
It'd be all dark before we took it in.

27:27.080 --> 27:28.460
Time to head back down.

27:31.560 --> 27:32.640
But without you,

27:33.140 --> 27:35.020
without our friends,

27:35.760 --> 27:37.360
the past five years have felt so slow.

27:37.880 --> 27:40.280
Like an afternoon nap
you couldn't wake up from.

27:41.340 --> 27:42.180
What about you?

27:42.220 --> 27:45.600
Did your time go by fast or slow?

27:46.320 --> 27:48.600
Was it because you met new people?

27:48.640 --> 27:50.080
People you liked better?

27:50.120 --> 27:52.180
Did they make your days flow quicker?

27:53.360 --> 27:54.580
If that's true,

27:55.080 --> 27:57.940
I guess I'd feel a little sad.

27:58.440 --> 27:59.840
But only a little.

28:00.860 --> 28:01.940
Because if you're doing well,

28:01.980 --> 28:04.260
I'll feel like I'm doing okay too.

28:04.880 --> 28:05.720
Still,

28:06.220 --> 28:07.640
I hope you tell your new friends this.

28:08.640 --> 28:09.620
Your name is Jiang Qiaoxi.

28:10.120 --> 28:10.980
It means

28:11.480 --> 28:13.960
the most beautiful sunset glow
on the mountaintop of Qunshan.

28:15.920 --> 28:16.980
Jiang Qiaoxi,

28:17.480 --> 28:18.700
writing this letter

28:19.200 --> 28:21.000
took every piece of courage I had.

28:21.040 --> 28:22.960
I was afraid you might've forgotten me.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.600
But then I thought,

28:24.640 --> 28:26.040
if it's really you,

28:26.680 --> 28:28.180
you wouldn't.

28:29.080 --> 28:30.540
So, can you tell me?

28:31.040 --> 28:32.580
I know you're probably busy,

28:32.620 --> 28:34.480
maybe buried in math problems,

28:35.240 --> 28:36.260
but

28:36.300 --> 28:38.540
if one day you're not so busy,

28:38.580 --> 28:40.420
could you come back to Qunshan?

28:41.840 --> 28:43.320
I want to go up the mountain

28:43.820 --> 28:45.940
with you again to watch the sunset.

28:46.560 --> 28:47.900
I want to hear you tell me

28:48.400 --> 28:49.480
how the past five years

28:49.980 --> 28:51.060
have been for you.

28:51.560 --> 28:52.680
Did your time

28:53.180 --> 28:55.520
go by fast or slowly?

28:56.020 --> 28:58.660
From your Lin Yingtao, hoping to watch

28:59.160 --> 29:01.860
another sunset with you on the mountaintop

29:02.560 --> 29:03.500
of Qunshan.

29:06.260 --> 29:07.100
Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:22.860 --> 29:24.640
It's okay, Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:26.520 --> 29:27.940
Really, it's fine.

29:29.260 --> 29:30.980
As long as you're alright,
that's what matters.

29:37.620 --> 29:38.980
Why did you say

29:39.480 --> 29:40.600
as long as I am alright?

29:41.740 --> 29:43.060
I heard everything.

29:43.560 --> 29:45.400
Cen Xiaoman came to find me.

29:45.440 --> 29:47.960
She said your boss
got taken in for questioning.

29:50.180 --> 29:51.400
You didn't do anything wrong,

29:51.900 --> 29:53.220
- did you?
- Relax.

29:54.020 --> 29:54.860
Sit down.

29:57.420 --> 29:59.060
I quit before

29:59.560 --> 30:00.640
anything could go wrong.

30:01.200 --> 30:02.300
Then why are you crying?

30:03.900 --> 30:04.960
Because of the stock market?

30:05.000 --> 30:05.840
No.

30:06.500 --> 30:07.720
Hey, it's okay.

30:07.760 --> 30:09.940
Money comes and goes.

30:09.980 --> 30:11.960
As long as you're safe,
that's all I care about.

30:12.000 --> 30:13.200
It's not about the market.

30:13.700 --> 30:16.500
I already sold all my shares.

30:16.540 --> 30:17.900
You did?

30:18.820 --> 30:20.840
You sold everything and didn't tell me?

30:21.560 --> 30:23.520
You quit your job and didn't tell me?

30:23.560 --> 30:24.860
Nothing you care to share, is it?

30:37.040 --> 30:38.760
- What are you doing?
- Come here.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.480
Why?

30:57.820 --> 30:59.820
Don't tell me you used the stock money

31:00.320 --> 31:01.460
to buy the ring?

31:05.400 --> 31:06.820
Jiang Qiaoxi, what have you done?

31:07.920 --> 31:08.760
Relax.

31:09.300 --> 31:10.140
There's enough.

31:11.600 --> 31:12.440
Yingtao,

31:13.060 --> 31:14.260
I know

31:15.380 --> 31:16.700
saying this now

31:17.200 --> 31:18.180
might be pretentious.

31:20.020 --> 31:21.000
But

31:22.060 --> 31:23.660
I still want to ask.

31:24.740 --> 31:27.900
Will you spend your life with me?

31:33.940 --> 31:36.100
Haven't I already been doing that?

31:36.140 --> 31:37.680
That's different.

31:39.460 --> 31:40.560
Will you?

31:52.000 --> 31:53.120
Come on.

32:15.440 --> 32:16.440
You're blinding me.

32:16.940 --> 32:18.820
Okay, okay, stop flashing it around.

32:18.860 --> 32:20.400
That ring's too bright.

32:20.440 --> 32:21.600
It's so shiny.

32:24.980 --> 32:26.100
Qiaoxi,

32:26.140 --> 32:27.680
how long are you two staying

32:28.180 --> 32:29.200
this time?

32:29.240 --> 32:31.200
Just the weekend.

32:31.240 --> 32:33.720
I still have classes,
so we have to head back soon.

32:37.460 --> 32:38.300
Alright.

32:39.400 --> 32:42.060
I know you've both got things to do
back in Hongyang.

32:42.560 --> 32:43.680
It's fine.

32:45.460 --> 32:46.700
You're both grown now.

32:46.740 --> 32:48.560
You've got your own careers.

32:49.060 --> 32:51.680
If you're back for a couple of days,
just enjoy them.

32:53.780 --> 32:54.720
Qiaoxi,

32:54.760 --> 32:56.840
I'll make extra jujube buns this time.

32:56.880 --> 32:57.940
And stuffed lotus root too.

32:57.980 --> 32:59.560
Take them home, put them in the freezer.

33:00.460 --> 33:01.700
That's too much trouble, Auntie.

33:01.740 --> 33:03.040
You could just teach me the recipe.

33:03.080 --> 33:04.500
I'll make them for Yingtao

33:04.540 --> 33:05.600
when we're back in Hongyang.

33:06.220 --> 33:07.120
That won't do.

33:07.160 --> 33:08.420
Better teach me instead.

33:08.960 --> 33:10.460
He does all the cooking now.

33:10.500 --> 33:12.960
If he ever gets sick of it
and starts bossing me around,

33:13.500 --> 33:14.820
I'll need something to reign him in.

33:15.840 --> 33:16.920
So clever, aren't you?

33:18.080 --> 33:19.960
- This kid.
- Uncle, Auntie,

33:20.460 --> 33:22.380
there's something I'd like to say.

33:23.960 --> 33:26.460
Even though Yingtao and I
haven't had the wedding yet,

33:27.140 --> 33:28.260
I was wondering

33:28.820 --> 33:31.300
if I could start calling you
Mom and Dad from today.

33:36.060 --> 33:37.360
If you want to, go ahead.

33:38.020 --> 33:40.220
We've seen you as family
since you were little.

33:42.920 --> 33:44.740
Well then, it all depends

33:44.780 --> 33:46.400
on how you behave from now on.

34:06.140 --> 34:07.200
Dad.

34:21.260 --> 34:22.280
Mom.

34:33.100 --> 34:33.940
That's more like it.

34:35.760 --> 34:38.000
Since Jiang Qiaoxi's changed
how he addresses you,

34:38.040 --> 34:39.340
can we skip the red envelopes?

34:39.380 --> 34:41.219
No way.

34:41.260 --> 34:43.860
- Tradition is tradition.
- He's already calling you Mom and Dad,

34:43.900 --> 34:45.500
so no need for red envelopes
at the wedding,

34:45.540 --> 34:47.199
- right?
- Listen to this penny pincher.

34:47.239 --> 34:48.360
Yingtao,

34:48.400 --> 34:49.260
you're starting

34:49.300 --> 34:51.540
a new chapter with Qiaoxi now.

34:51.580 --> 34:53.139
You two are your own family.

34:53.179 --> 34:56.040
You've got to start planning
for your own little household.

34:56.080 --> 34:57.220
No way.

34:57.260 --> 34:58.700
Even if I have my own family,

34:58.740 --> 35:00.340
I'll always love Mom and Dad the most.

35:00.380 --> 35:01.860
That's not how it works.

35:01.900 --> 35:04.060
From now on,
you two are building a life together.

35:04.100 --> 35:06.020
Take care of each other.

35:07.560 --> 35:09.820
And if anything ever happens, call me.

35:11.180 --> 35:12.220
‪Sure.

35:12.260 --> 35:13.560
What are you "sure" about?

35:13.600 --> 35:15.380
Know what that means?
Let me break it down.

35:16.860 --> 35:18.420
My dad is saying

35:18.920 --> 35:20.300
don't you dare bully me.

35:20.340 --> 35:21.320
Because if you do,

35:21.360 --> 35:22.680
I'll give him a call.

35:22.720 --> 35:24.040
He'll show up

35:24.800 --> 35:26.180
- and give you a beating.
- Hey, don't.

35:26.680 --> 35:28.040
- You're gonna break him.
- It's fine.

35:28.080 --> 35:29.720
- Hurts your heart?
- Of course it does.

35:31.700 --> 35:32.700
You poked through it.

35:32.740 --> 35:34.500
Oh no, it's broken.

35:35.820 --> 35:36.660
Let me see.

35:37.800 --> 35:39.020
Looks good. Really nice.

35:39.520 --> 35:40.420
Good.

35:40.460 --> 35:43.240
Mine doesn't look as good as yours.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.320
Looks great to me.

35:44.360 --> 35:45.800
You'll get the hang of it.

35:46.680 --> 35:47.520
Okay.

35:52.160 --> 35:53.200
Yingtao.

35:53.240 --> 35:55.980
Does Qiaoxi still stay
in touch with his parents?

35:59.800 --> 36:01.400
Same as always.

36:01.900 --> 36:03.520
You know what his family's like.

36:03.560 --> 36:06.280
He can hold a conversation
with Uncle Jiang now,

36:06.780 --> 36:08.800
but it's still pretty distant.

36:09.340 --> 36:10.780
Auntie Liang

36:10.820 --> 36:13.740
calls once in a while, checks in briefly.

36:14.240 --> 36:16.180
But the calls don't last a minute
before she hangs up.

36:22.620 --> 36:23.580
There's something

36:24.080 --> 36:25.920
his mom didn't want me
to tell you back then.

36:26.780 --> 36:28.820
But now that you and Qiaoxi are married,

36:28.860 --> 36:30.000
I think

36:30.040 --> 36:31.760
I should tell you.

36:32.720 --> 36:33.760
What is it?

36:34.260 --> 36:35.320
How are things at work?

36:35.360 --> 36:36.600
A couple of years ago,

36:36.640 --> 36:39.720
his mom came back
from her post in Nigeria.

36:39.760 --> 36:40.960
She came by our place.

36:41.600 --> 36:43.820
Do you know why she came?

36:45.860 --> 36:47.300
Why?

36:47.340 --> 36:49.880
To do exactly what you're doing now.

37:16.640 --> 37:17.740
At the time,

37:18.460 --> 37:19.920
watching her,

37:19.960 --> 37:21.640
I suddenly understood her.

37:22.660 --> 37:24.160
Anyone in her situation,

37:24.200 --> 37:25.740
anyone at all,

37:25.780 --> 37:27.280
would've crumbled.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.600
It gets exhausting sometimes.

37:35.640 --> 37:37.080
But you've still got

37:37.820 --> 37:38.660
to live life

37:38.700 --> 37:39.760
the best you can.

37:39.800 --> 37:40.640
When we get back,

37:40.680 --> 37:42.600
I'll let him know about this.

37:43.380 --> 37:46.220
Thinking about you getting married
still tugs at my heart a little.

37:49.200 --> 37:50.200
Alright, alright.

37:51.040 --> 37:52.180
Yingtao.

37:52.860 --> 37:55.040
You are the best daughter
in the whole wide world.

37:56.620 --> 37:59.360
And you're the best mom
in the whole wide world too.

37:59.860 --> 38:00.920
So much so,

38:01.420 --> 38:03.740
I almost don't want
to share you with Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:03.780 --> 38:04.620
What?

38:05.520 --> 38:07.180
What is it you don't want to share?

38:13.460 --> 38:15.380
Dear Lin Yingtao of 16 years old.

38:15.880 --> 38:18.180
Hey. It's Jiang Qiaoxi. I'm 25 now.

38:19.280 --> 38:20.360
Sorry

38:20.400 --> 38:22.360
it took me nine years to write back.

38:22.940 --> 38:25.240
Still, I hope you receive it.

38:26.120 --> 38:28.400
Maybe it's a good thing I replied late.

38:28.980 --> 38:30.580
Now I can finally tell you

38:30.620 --> 38:32.260
about our life for the past nine years.

38:33.380 --> 38:34.620
Do you want

38:34.660 --> 38:36.060
to hear the ending first?

38:36.720 --> 38:38.320
It's a happy one.

38:38.860 --> 38:40.460
We're getting married soon.

38:40.960 --> 38:42.200
These days,

38:42.240 --> 38:43.540
we share the same parents,

38:44.040 --> 38:45.260
live under the same roof,

38:45.760 --> 38:46.760
share the same meals,

38:47.260 --> 38:48.860
even use the same body wash.

38:50.200 --> 38:51.300
I wonder

38:51.800 --> 38:52.980
if this is the kind of life

38:53.520 --> 38:54.700
you'd like.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.440
But you probably weren't

38:57.940 --> 38:59.300
thinking that far ahead at 16.

38:59.340 --> 39:00.180
Well…

39:00.220 --> 39:01.760
What I'm feeling right now is…

39:02.260 --> 39:03.960
Over these nine years,

39:04.000 --> 39:05.640
all the time I spent alone,

39:06.140 --> 39:07.340
I got through it

39:07.880 --> 39:09.420
by picturing us together

39:09.460 --> 39:11.460
watching sunsets in Qunshan.

39:11.500 --> 39:12.200
Watch out.

39:12.240 --> 39:13.880
- That's how I held on.
- Why two cakes?

39:14.520 --> 39:15.620
I made believe

39:15.660 --> 39:18.120
you were part of everything I did.

39:18.760 --> 39:20.560
- That way,
- You prefer this one?

39:20.600 --> 39:21.600
the future

39:22.280 --> 39:23.140
didn't feel so dark.

39:27.720 --> 39:30.720
When I first left Qunshan
and couldn't see you anymore,

39:31.220 --> 39:32.520
I used to picture myself

39:33.020 --> 39:34.280
still by your side.

39:35.120 --> 39:37.920
Saving the chocolates my teacher gave me,

39:37.960 --> 39:39.960
bringing you your favorite peanut milk,

39:40.500 --> 39:42.260
heading to the hills with you and Chunlu

39:42.300 --> 39:43.740
- to catch the sunset.
- Feel it?

39:51.620 --> 39:53.800
Yingtao, do you remember

39:54.340 --> 39:55.680
when we were kids,

39:56.640 --> 39:57.480
sitting right here

39:58.220 --> 39:59.180
reading Harry Potter?

39:59.720 --> 40:00.820
Excuse me.

40:01.980 --> 40:04.780
Back then, you didn't even
read it yourself.

40:04.820 --> 40:06.080
You made me read it to you.

40:07.100 --> 40:08.040
And

40:08.080 --> 40:10.860
we definitely never sat on a hilltop
to read Harry Potter.

40:10.900 --> 40:11.740
You remember it wrong.

40:11.780 --> 40:13.140
I'm sure we did.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.120
You just don't know it yet.

40:17.760 --> 40:19.040
Back in junior high,

40:19.080 --> 40:20.520
I used to imagine

40:20.560 --> 40:22.280
we'd never been apart.

40:22.320 --> 40:24.000
That we were still in school together,

40:24.040 --> 40:26.360
still reading Harry Potter side by side.

40:30.780 --> 40:32.020
But Yingtao,

40:32.060 --> 40:33.380
now I don't have

40:33.420 --> 40:34.700
to imagine anymore.

40:34.740 --> 40:35.860
Because in this moment,

40:36.360 --> 40:37.940
you're really here with me.

40:41.060 --> 40:43.740
The sunset tonight is stunning.

40:44.240 --> 40:46.520
I wish I could scoop it up
and hand it to you,

40:47.020 --> 40:48.200
so you could carry it with you.

40:48.700 --> 40:50.060
Just like

40:50.100 --> 40:51.820
how you gave me that amber necklace

40:51.860 --> 40:53.160
you are always wearing.

40:55.380 --> 40:56.880
But here's the problem, Yingtao.

40:57.520 --> 40:58.920
I can't give you piece of sunset.

40:59.420 --> 41:00.820
But I'm greedy.

41:01.320 --> 41:03.780
Because now I want to try
your jujube buns too.

41:05.000 --> 41:08.120
Do you think Yingtao
nine years down the road

41:08.620 --> 41:09.960
would make them for me?

41:10.940 --> 41:11.820
I think you,

41:13.060 --> 41:14.220
nine years from now,

41:14.720 --> 41:16.020
probably would.

41:17.180 --> 41:19.880
From your Jiang Qiaoxi,
watching the sunset

41:20.740 --> 41:21.620
with you.

41:59.100 --> 42:00.680
You are so grown up now.

42:02.780 --> 42:05.420
And today, you're even becoming a bride.

42:12.580 --> 42:13.420
Yeah.

42:14.220 --> 42:15.660
I'm getting married today.

42:17.480 --> 42:20.040
Is it the same as how you'd imagine it?

42:20.820 --> 42:23.060
Honestly, I never imagined
myself in a wedding dress.

42:23.560 --> 42:26.500
I didn't even think much about growing up.

42:27.280 --> 42:28.620
And now that you see it all,

42:29.240 --> 42:30.520
do you like it?

42:31.840 --> 42:34.320
Are you still fearless
like you used to be?

42:34.860 --> 42:35.700
Of course.

42:36.880 --> 42:38.160
But

42:39.220 --> 42:40.900
being a grown-up

42:42.640 --> 42:45.520
sometimes means pretending to be scared.

42:46.620 --> 42:47.660
Then,

42:47.700 --> 42:49.460
do you love the person you're marrying?

42:54.540 --> 42:56.460
Yes, and I can't love him more.

43:00.080 --> 43:01.380
He's the one you always pictured.

43:10.080 --> 43:11.280
So,

43:11.320 --> 43:12.160
am I handsome?

43:13.380 --> 43:14.740
Are you really me?

43:17.140 --> 43:18.660
Why wouldn't I be?

43:19.200 --> 43:20.260
You're so smiley now.

43:20.840 --> 43:22.000
The real you

43:22.520 --> 43:23.980
always loved to smile.

43:26.180 --> 43:27.180
And the real you

43:27.220 --> 43:28.960
has been woken up.

43:30.020 --> 43:31.560
The one who woke you up,

43:32.500 --> 43:33.380
was it Yingtao?

43:34.480 --> 43:35.580
Who else

43:37.180 --> 43:38.340
could it be?

43:38.840 --> 43:40.600
In fairy tales,

43:40.640 --> 43:43.180
the princess marries the prince,

43:43.680 --> 43:47.020
and they live happily ever after.

43:48.660 --> 43:50.160
But the story always ends there.

43:50.660 --> 43:51.820
Is that real?

43:53.340 --> 43:56.360
Will they really live happily ever after?

43:56.900 --> 43:58.480
Are you wondering

43:58.980 --> 44:00.820
if Jiang Qiaoxi and I

44:01.540 --> 44:03.260
can stay like this forever?

44:05.800 --> 44:07.200
Staying happy…

44:09.720 --> 44:11.860
isn't easy after all.

44:14.180 --> 44:15.180
In the future,

44:16.640 --> 44:18.460
we'll definitely face tough times,

44:19.120 --> 44:22.760
bad weather, ups and downs.

44:24.260 --> 44:26.000
But as long as I'm by his side

44:27.480 --> 44:28.740
and he's by mine,

44:32.580 --> 44:33.960
I'm not afraid of anything.

44:36.920 --> 44:38.980
What I want most now

44:40.580 --> 44:42.040
is to stay by her side.

44:44.880 --> 44:45.900
So Yingtao…

44:48.040 --> 44:49.220
can always be Yingtao.

44:50.280 --> 44:51.380
Keep it up and good luck.

44:55.320 --> 44:56.160
Don't worry.

44:57.660 --> 44:58.500
I will.

44:59.000 --> 45:00.660
Then I like it.

45:00.700 --> 45:01.700
I like it very much.

45:02.220 --> 45:04.760
I like who you grew up to be.
The fearless you.

45:19.120 --> 45:20.800
Jiang Qiaoxi, look.

45:23.760 --> 45:24.920
Why do you wear those?

45:26.080 --> 45:28.560
Red shoes with a white dress?
You're jumping into--

45:29.820 --> 45:31.380
Exactly.

45:33.680 --> 45:35.560
I want to leap right into life with you,

45:36.260 --> 45:38.140
wearing these heels.

45:48.720 --> 45:49.700
Jiang Qiaoxi,

45:50.240 --> 45:52.400
you may now kiss your bride.

46:14.040 --> 46:19.640
THE END

48:37.780 --> 48:41.860
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
